  "finding": "Per-call overhead (system message, state digest, recent turns) is about 20-28 thousand characters, so the budget mostly limits the number of turns. A frugal habit (monthly current readings of each running crop plus the predictor) needs about 4.0 million characters over 139 calls for a full campaign; the heavy habit (weekly 512-record windows) is stopped within the first five weeks at every budget from 2 to 6 million. The contract-v7 value of 2 million stops the frugal habit on day 210.",
  "code": "harness with compact endgame prompt and exhaustion-day logging (this commit)"
